---
// src/pages/panduan.astro — Panduan Mode Belajar
const title = 'Panduan Mode Belajar — ALYNNE.EDU';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>{title}</title>
<style>
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { background: #0D0C0A; color: #E7E5E4; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1rem; }
  h1 { color: #A8A29E; font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #2B2723; padding-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  h2 { color: var(--accent-soft); font-size: 1.3rem; margin: 2rem 0 1rem; }
  h3 { color: var(--accent-soft); font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 0.5rem; }
  p { margin: 0.5rem 0; color: #D6D3D1; }
  ul, ol { margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; }
  li { margin: 0.3rem 0; color: #D6D3D1; }
  code { background: #171513; padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #f0abfc; }
  pre { background: #171513; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; overflow-x: auto; margin: 1rem 0; border: 1px solid #2B2723; }
  pre code { background: none; padding: 0; color: #a3e635; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 1rem 0; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid #2B2723; padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; text-align: left; font-size: 0.9rem; }
  th { background: #171513; color: var(--accent-soft); }
  td { color: #D6D3D1; }
  strong { color: #FAFAF9; }
  .alert { background: #1c1917; border: 1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.25); padding: 1rem 1.5rem; margin: 1rem 0; border-radius: 8px; }
  .alert strong { color: #fbbf24; }
  .ok { border-color: rgba(16,185,129,0.25); }
  .ok strong { color: #34d399; }
  .bad { border-color: rgba(239,68,68,0.3); }
  .bad strong { color: #f87171; }
  a { color: #A8A29E; text-decoration: none; }
  a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .toc { background: #171513; border: 1px solid #2B2723; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem 1.5rem; margin: 1.5rem 0; }
  .toc a { display: block; margin: 0.25rem 0; }
  hr { border: none; border-top: 1px solid #2B2723; margin: 2rem 0; }
  .back { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 1rem; padding: 0.5rem 1rem; background: #C2410C; color: white; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.9rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<a href="/edu" class="back">← Kembali ke Alynne</a>

<h1>Panduan Mode Belajar</h1>

<div class="toc">
  <strong style="color:var(--accent-soft)">Daftar Isi</strong>
  <a href="#cara">1. Cara Pakai</a>
  <a href="#tab">2. Navigasi Tab</a>
  <a href="#trouble">3. Troubleshooting</a>
  <a href="#status">4. Status Fitur</a>
  <a href="#limit">5. Limitasi</a>
</div>

<h2 id="cara">1. Cara Pakai (3 Langkah)</h2>

<h3>Langkah 1: Masukkan Materi</h3>
<p>Pilih salah satu:</p>
<p><strong>A. Upload Dokumen</strong> (PDF, DOCX, PPTX, XLSX, Gambar)</p>
<ol>
  <li>Scroll ke <strong>"Upload Dokumen"</strong> di panel STT</li>
  <li>Drag & drop atau klik untuk pilih file</li>
  <li>Klik <strong>"Konversi ke Teks"</strong></li>
  <li>Tunggu 2-30 detik</li>
</ol>
<p><strong>B. Paste Teks</strong></p>
<ol>
  <li>Klik <strong>"Clear"</strong> (hapus transcript lama)</li>
  <li>Paste teks ke area transkrip</li>
</ol>
<p><strong>C. YouTube Transcript</strong></p>
<ol>
  <li>Paste URL YouTube di kotak YouTube Transkrip</li>
  <li>Klik "Ambil"</li>
</ol>

<h3>Langkah 2: Klik Mode Belajar</h3>
<ol>
  <li>Klik <strong>"Mode Belajar"</strong> di sidebar (kartu hijau)</li>
  <li>Hasil muncul <strong>INSTANT</strong> (~0.2 detik)</li>
  <li>15 bab + 30 kuis + ringkasan siap dibaca</li>
</ol>

<div class="alert">
  <strong>PENTING!</strong> Sebelum upload materi baru, selalu klik <strong>"Clear"</strong> dulu. Kalau tidak, transcript lama + baru tercampur.
</div>

<h2 id="tab">2. Navigasi Tab</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Tab</th><th>Fungsi</th></tr>
  <tr><td><strong>Ringkasan</strong></td><td>Summary padat dari materi</td></tr>
  <tr><td><strong>Materi</strong></td><td>Konten per bab (klik bab di sidebar)</td></tr>
  <tr><td><strong>Kuis</strong></td><td>30 soal fill-in-the-blank</td></tr>
  <tr><td><strong>Mindmap</strong></td><td>Peta konsep dari keyword</td></tr>
  <tr><td><strong>Tanya AI</strong></td><td>Chat dengan AI (no signup)</td></tr>
  <tr><td><strong>Voice Tutor</strong></td><td>Bacakan materi dengan suara</td></tr>
  <tr><td><strong>Sesi Belajar</strong></td><td>Pomodoro + Focus Detector</td></tr>
</table>

<h2 id="trouble">3. Troubleshooting</h2>

<div class="alert bad">
  <strong>Materi masih yang lama?</strong><br>
  Klik <strong>"Clear"</strong> → upload/paste dokumen BARU → klik Mode Belajar
</div>

<div class="alert bad">
  <strong>Materi tab kosong?</strong><br>
  Hard refresh: F12 → klik kanan refresh → "Empty Cache and Hard Reload"
</div>

<div class="alert bad">
  <strong>"Server sedang sibuk"?</strong><br>
  Sudah di-fix. JS pipeline = instant (0.2 detik). Jika muncul lagi: Console → <code>localStorage.clear()</code> → refresh
</div>

<h2 id="status">4. Status Fitur</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Fitur</th><th>Status</th><th>Catatan</th></tr>
  <tr><td>JS Pipeline (instant)</td><td>Jalan</td><td>150ms, 15 bab, 30 kuis</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Materi tab</td><td>Jalan</td><td>Auto-select bab 1</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Kuis tab</td><td>Jalan</td><td>30 fill-in-the-blank</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Ringkasan</td><td>Jalan</td><td>TF-IDF extractive</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Mindmap</td><td>Jalan</td><td>Keyword tree</td></tr>
  <tr><td>LLM Enhancement</td><td>Nonaktif</td><td>Stabilitas (no warning)</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Visualisasi</td><td>Kosong</td><td>Butuh LLM</td></tr>
</table>

<h2 id="limit">5. Limitasi</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Kuis = fill-in-the-blank (bukan multiple choice) — butuh LLM</li>
  <li>Materi per bab = potongan teks (bukan penjelasan yang dirangkai ulang)</li>
  <li>Ringkasan = extractive (pilih kalimat) bukan abstractive (rewrite)</li>
  <li>Visualisasi = kosong (butuh LLM)</li>
  <li>Bab judul = top keywords (bukan AI-generated)</li>
</ul>

<hr>
<p style="color:#78716C; font-size:0.8rem; text-align:center;">
  ALYNNE.EDU v18-nvidia — 2026-10-29<br>
  <a href="/edu">← Kembali ke Aplikasi</a>
</p>

</body>
</html>
